    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct oral bioavailability measurement exists for the exact query molecule.",
    "The query differs from cefuroxime axetil in the C7 substituent (1-hydroxyethyl versus furan methoxyimino acetamido) and the ester alkyl (acetoxymethyl versus 1-acetoxyethyl); impact on permeability and esterase stability is unmeasured.",
    "No query-specific Caco-2 permeability, solubility, or dissolution measurement is available.",
